Hunt for security misconfiguration (heuristic — not pure taint). Look for: debug/development mode enabled, default or permissive CORS (allow-origin *), missing security headers, directory listing, verbose error pages/stack traces returned to clients, permissive cookie flags (no HttpOnly/Secure/SameSite), exposed admin/actuator/management endpoints, and dangerous default settings. Cite the exact config/code line.
